Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://git.ti.com/git/edgeai/meta-edgeai.git

Package: libtivision-apps11.2.0
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
 libc6,
 libgcc-s1,
 libstdc++6,
 libegl1,
 libgbm1,
 libgles2,
 libti-rpmsg-char0
Description: TI OpenVX Middleware Library
 libtivision_apps is the TI Vision Apps shared library providing OpenVX
 middleware functions for TI K3 SoCs (J721E, J784S4, J722S, J742S2, AM62A).
 It integrates TI's TIOVX OpenVX implementation with hardware accelerators
 including C7x DSP, MMA, VPAC, and DMPAC.
 .
 Compatible with: j721e, j721s2, j784s4, j742s2, j722s, am62axx.

Package: libtivision-apps-dev
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, libtivision-apps11.2.0 (= ${binary:Version})
Description: TI OpenVX Middleware Library - development files
 C++ headers for building against libtivision_apps. Includes the full
 processor_sdk header tree: vision_apps, tiovx, app_utils, imaging,
 video_io, vxlib, tiadalg, tidl_j7, and ti-perception-toolkit.

Package: ti-vision-apps-data
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, libtivision-apps11.2.0 (= ${binary:Version})
Description: TI Vision Apps - runtime data and demo applications
 Sensor DCC calibration binaries for ISP (ar0233, ar0820, imx219, imx390,
 imx728) and demonstration application binaries for TI EdgeAI/ADAS EVMs.
 Includes vision_apps_init.sh and vx_app_* test/demo executables.
